# Local state: the pseudonym map, the egress ledger, the cache, run artifacts.
# Never commit these — map.json is the half that must not leave the machine.
.addgp/*
# …except the project description, which the repository ships so that
# `addgp-lite selfcheck` is reproducible for anyone who receives the binary.
!.addgp/description.md

